From 49934ba9ccd3c9cc71688b5d60ea8511265d95c1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tobias <ruck.tobias@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 7 Mar 2021 14:02:07 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Add fRequireStandardConsensus global and
 -allownonstdtxnconsensus option (#39)

Rebase provenance: this historical change was adapted onto the pinned
Bitcoin ABC base. Source diff is the recorded Lotus V1 replay commit below.

Historical-source-commit: cb422b7ec84450dbc3e0287ac358e00c5e141942
Recorded-replay-commit: 5936229eb930a6d7260edbf3ed6e7b9103d4b9af

